{"id":"kolu-watch-mutes","ord":"a1","title":"mutes","desc":"One child per muted terminal, `terminal` prop carrying the bare id. THE ONE MUTE LIST (the human's ruling 2026-08-29): the server's watcher reads it live, and the orchestrator derives its Monitor's --ignore flags from the same children before arming. The rules: mute only after verifying the disposition; ids rotate on kaval restart — re-identify by intent/cwd, never a cached id; entries whose terminals no longer exist are removed, re-added on reappearance re-identified.","created":"2026-08-29T08:31:02-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T08:51:28-04:00"}
